Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:08:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 50/50] Control panel: bring it over for the revised code base

EVEmuControlPanel.ps1 and "EVEmu Control Panel.bat" from the movement
branch (CRLF line endings kept), with these changes:

- the server image is evemu_server_revised (docker-compose.yml too), so
  Start builds this code base instead of starting an image built from the
  old one on the new universe
- no SEED_MARKET for the tasks: nothing reads it, and the market sim fills
  the market by itself
- first build estimates of 15 to 30 minutes (a larger code base)
- the folder is "your EVEmu folder", not evemu_Crucible
- when the containers belong to another folder, it says how to move them
  (docker rm server db keeps each folder's universe in its volumes)

Wipe still runs docker compose down -v, which now deletes db_revised and
the revised caches; the old db volume isn't declared here and is kept.
